                                "sense_id": "b6954590-9daf-31be-8a64-8394e9564e2f",
                                "text": "[Space] cannot be a created Subſtance; becauſe vve cannot conceive it creable or annihilable; and therefore it carries vvith it an Idea of neceſſary Exiſtence; […]"
